WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Open PHP Versions and install the branches your two sites need.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Pin catalog to PHP 8.3 and studio to PHP 8.5 in each project's PHP & tools settings.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The sites returned 8.3.36 and 8.5.12. The Windows CLI used the global default, 8.4.27.
